Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从水中感觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从地上感觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it in the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从空气中嗅到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell it in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much that once was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已失落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有人记得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For none now live who remember it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:04.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,《指环王》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都从铸造魔戒开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It began with the forging of the Great Rings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵族得到三只戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three were given to the Elves:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们长生不老，也是最有智慧、最公平的种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immortal, wisest and fairest of all beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人族分到七只戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven to the Dwarf-lords:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们擅长挖掘矿坑，是山洞的巧心工匠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great miners and craftsmen of the mountain halls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,则分到九只戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine rings were gifted to the race of Men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比别人更贪图权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, above all else, desire power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,（中土世界）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每只戒指都拥有统治各种族的意志与力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For within these rings was bound the strength and will to govern each race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们都受到欺骗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they were all of them deceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为另外还有一只被铸造了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For another ring was made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,（魔多）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在魔多末日火山的烈焰中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the land of Mordor, in the fires of Mount Doom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:02:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君索伦暗地里铸造了可以奴役世界的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dark Lord Sauron forged in secret a Master Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to control all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在魔戒中注入他的邪恶、残酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into this Ring he poured his cruelty, his malice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及统治天下的可怕欲望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his will to dominate all life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只驾驭一切的至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Ring to rule them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个接一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土世界的自由之士感受到至尊魔戒的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Free Lands of Middle-earth fell to the power of the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有些人群起反抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there were some who resisted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,组成了精灵和人类的最后同盟，对抗魔多的邪恶兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Last Alliance of Men and Elves marched against the armies of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在险恶的末日火山为中土世界的自由奋战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on the slopes of Mount Doom, they fought for the freedom of Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利终于在望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory was near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是至尊魔戒的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the power of the Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人能敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could not be undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in this moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都失去希望之际{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all hope had faded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,人皇之子埃西铎拾起他父亲的宝剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Isildur, son of the king, took up his father's sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君索伦，中土世界，自由之民死敌终于被击败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron, the enemy of the Free Peoples of Middle-earth, was defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒落入埃西铎手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring passed to Isildur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只有一次机会永恒地摧毁邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who had this one chance to destroy evil forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人心…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the hearts of Men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易受到蛊惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are easily corrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且魔戒有它自己的意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Ring of Power has a will of its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它背叛了埃西铎…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It betrayed Isildur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后害死了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该被遗忘的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some things that should not have been forgotten…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也遗失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史成为传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}History became legend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说成为神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}legend became myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千五百年来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for two and a half thousand years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒的下落无人得知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ring passed out of all knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运巧妙的安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until, when chance came…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它蛊惑一个新的持有者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ensnared a new bearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:06:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒落入咕鲁手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring came to the creature Gollum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他带到迷雾山脉的洞穴中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took it deep into the tunnels of the Misty Mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身心完全被魔戒占据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there it consumed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的，我的爱，我一个人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own. My love. My own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒让咕鲁得到违反自然的长寿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring brought to Gollum unnatural long life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百年来它扭曲他的心智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 500 years it poisoned his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在咕鲁阴暗的洞穴中静静地等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the gloom of Gollum's cave, it waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗再度笼罩大地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness crept back into the forests of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东方谣言四起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor grew of a shadow in the East…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们心中产生无言的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whispers of a nameless fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是至尊魔戒知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Ring of Power perceived…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它即将再度现身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}its time had now come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:07:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它舍弃了咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It abandoned Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是出乎至尊魔戒的意料之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something happened then the Ring did not intend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被一个料想不到的人检到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was picked up by the most unlikely creature imaginable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个哈比人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔的比尔博巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo Baggins of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝不见了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious is lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久的将来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the time will soon come…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人将决定世界的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Hobbits will shape the fortunes of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔开垦纪元…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 22nd day of September…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,1400年…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the year 1400…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,九月第二十二日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Shire-reckoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,袋底洞、袋射排、哈比屯、西区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bag End, Bagshot Row, Hobbiton, West farthing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Shire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三纪元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Third Age of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:14.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《护戒使者》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,“去而复返：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There and Back Again:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hobbit's Tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博巴金斯著”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,（去而复返：哈比人的故事 比尔博巴金斯著）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where to begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,“关于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Concerning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,（关于哈比人）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,“千百年来，哈比人一直都定居在夏尔的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits have been living and farming in the four Farthings of the Shire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个区域务农{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for many hundreds of years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:09:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全无视于外界的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite content to ignore and be ignored…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也满足于被外界忽视的状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the world of the Big Folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟中土世界充满了数不清的奇异生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle-earth being, after all, full of strange creatures beyond count…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人一定显得不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits must seem of little importance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们既不是骁勇的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}being neither renowned as great warriors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不被认为特别有智慧”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor counted among the very wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！有人在敲门，{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo! Someone at the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,“事实上，有人曾经评论过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, it has been remarked by some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人唯一的狂热就是美食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Hobbits' only real passion is for food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这评论相当不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rather unfair observation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们也对酿啤酒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we have also developed a keen interest in the brewing of ales…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,和抽烟斗有浓厚的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the smoking of pipe-weed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们一心所系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where our hearts truly lie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是和平宁静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in peace and quiet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,与肥沃的农耕地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and good, tilled earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:10:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的哈比人都热爱能够生长的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all Hobbits share a love of things that grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,无庸置疑的，我们的生活方式对其他人而言非常奇特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, no doubt to others, our ways seem quaint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天，特别是今天，我特别感受到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today of all days, it is brought home to me:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安享宁谧的生活其实很不赖”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is no bad thing to celebrate a simple life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐 比尔博巴金斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！有人在敲门，{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sticklebacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那孩子跑到哪里去了？ - 佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is that boy? - Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前道路无止尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down from the door where it began{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜿蜒崎岖又漫长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I must follow if I can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然路程尚遥远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road goes ever on and on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前道路无止尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down from the door where it began{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然路程尚遥远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now far ahead the road has gone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我一定要继续前进 - 你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I must follow if I can - You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师绝对不会迟到，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wizard is never late, Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会早到，他一定准时照他想的时间到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor is he early. He arrives precisely when he means to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wonderful to see you, Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会错过你伯伯比尔博的生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I'd miss your Uncle Bilbo's birthday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老不死还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the old rascal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说生日宴会非常盛大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear it's going to be a party of special magnificence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道比尔博，他把这儿搞得鸡飞狗跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Bilbo. He's got the whole place in an uproar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他应该高兴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that should please him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔有一半的人被邀请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the Shire's been invited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的反正也会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest of them are turning up anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔的日子就这样继续下去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so life in the Shire goes on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上个纪元没有什么不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}very much as it has this past Age…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了新加入和刚逝去的人，改变很缓慢的进行着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of its own comings and goings, with change coming slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么改变的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it comes at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔的一切都制造得很坚固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For things are made to endure in the Shire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来一代传一代的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}passing from one generation to the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯家族一直都住在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always been a Baggins living here under the Hill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,袋底洞的山丘下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Bag End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会永远住在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there always will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的，比尔博最近怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, Bilbo's been a bit odd lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，比平常更怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, more than usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他常常把自己关在书房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken to locking himself in his study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他花好几个小时研究那些旧地图，以为我没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spends hours poring over old maps when he thinks I'm not looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's it gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像在搞什么名堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，你不说拉倒 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, then. Keep your secrets. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道这一定跟你有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know you have something to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你出现前，巴金斯家族声誊一向都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you came along, we Bagginses were very well thought of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从不冒险或犯规{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had any adventures or did anything unexpected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你指的是那次恶龙事件，那件事与我无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're referring to the incident with the dragon, I was barely involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是推了你叔叔一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was give your uncle a little nudge out of the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样，你都正式被列为捣乱分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you did, you've been officially labeled a disturber of the peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫！甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf! Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟火，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fireworks, Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘道夫！ - 烟火，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gandalf! - Fireworks, Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:14:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了我好高兴 - 我也是，好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm glad you're back. - So am I, dear boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,（和宴会无关者不准进入）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要，多谢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不欢迎访客、祝寿者或远亲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want any more visitors, well-wishers or distant relations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是一个老朋友呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about very old friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比尔博巴金斯 - 亲爱的甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bilbo Baggins. - My dear Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好，111岁大寿！谁会相信呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you. 111 years old! Who would believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都没老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't aged a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来，进来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝杯茶？或是小酌两杯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tea? Or maybe something a little stronger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有几瓶1296年的陈年好酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a few bottles of the Old Winyard left. 1296.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的年分，几乎跟我一样老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good year. Almost as old as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸珍藏的，开一瓶如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was laid down by my father. What say we open one, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝茶就好，谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tea, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上礼拜就该到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was expecting you sometime last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实也没关系，你一向都想来就来、说走就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters. You come and go as you please. Always have and always will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我有点措手不及，家里只有冻鸡和腌黄瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught me a bit unprepared. We've only got cold chicken and a bit of pickle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有乳酪，不行，太寒酸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some cheese here. No, that won't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有覆盆子果酱、苹果馅饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got raspberry jam, an apple tart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没什么可以当甜点的了，哦，不，我们没间题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not much for afters. Oh, no, we're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到一些海绵蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just found some sponge cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,（孤山）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以煮几颗蛋…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could make you some eggs if you'd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到哪儿去了？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茶就行了，谢谢 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tea, thank you. - Oh, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 介意我先吃吗？ - 你尽管吃吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't mind if I eat, do you? - No, not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博！比尔博巴金斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo! Bilbo Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我不在家！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not at home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是塞克维尔巴金斯家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Sackville-Bagginses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你在家！ - 他们想要这房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you're in there! - They're after the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么长毒，他们不肯放过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've never forgiven me for living this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被这些烦人的亲戚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to get away from these confounded relatives, hanging on the bell all day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵得一刻不得安宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}never giving me a moment's peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.12,0:18:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想再看到高耸的山脉，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see mountains again. Mountains, Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后找一个安静的地方写书，啊，茶滚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then find somewhere quiet where I can finish my book. Oh, tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的要实现你的计划？ - 对，一切都在计划中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you mean to go through with your plan? - Yes, yes. It's all in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都安排好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the arrangements are made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多起了疑心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo suspects something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，他是巴金斯家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he does. He's a Baggins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是硬瓶抱腹家的笨小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not some blockheaded Bracegirdle from Hardbottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告拆他吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell him, won't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会啦 - 他很爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, yes. - He's very fond of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开口的话他一定会跟我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd probably come with me if I asked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想，他还是衷心深爱夏尔的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think in his heart, Frodo's still in love with the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿油油的树林和草地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woods, the fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,潺潺的溪流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little rivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am old, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我看起来并不老，但是我的心老了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I don't look it, but I'm beginning to feel it in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意志变得很薄弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都索然无味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of stretched…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像面包上的奶油涂得不够多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like butter scraped over too much bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要假期，一个很长的假期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a holiday. A very long holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不打算回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't expect I shall return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打定主意不回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I mean not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老托比种的，南区最好的烟草{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Toby. The finest weed in the South farthing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫老友…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf, my old friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是令人难忘的一晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this will be a night to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐 比尔博巴金斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小胖博哲，很高兴见到你，欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatty Bolger. Lovely to see you. Welcome, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆，快去邀罗丝跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Sam. Ask Rosie for a dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想再喝一杯啤酒 - 不行啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I'll just have another ale. - Oh, no, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对三个可怕的食人妖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the mercy of three monstrous trolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们争吵着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were all arguing amongst themselves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么把我们煮来吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how they were going to cook us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一口就把我们给吞了，或是一个接着一个把我们压成酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it be turned on a spit, or to sit on us one by one, squash us into jelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喋喋不休吵个没完没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spent so much time arguing the whithertos and the whyfors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果天亮的第一道曙光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the sun's first light crept over the top of the trees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她们都变成石头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turned them all to stone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up they go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的那个啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯格德尔太太，真高兴看到你，欢迎欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Bracegirdle, how nice to see you. Welcome, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你的孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all these children yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，你还真是多产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious, you have been productive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞克维尔巴金斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sackville-Bagginses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:21:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好孩子，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good lad, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是个自私的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very selfish, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我很自私{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am. Very selfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么你父母过世的时候要收养你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I took you in after your mother and father died…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可不是想做善事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't out of charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那么多亲戚当中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all my numerous relations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巴金斯家族最有勇气的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were the one Baggins that showed real spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.32,0:22:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博，你刚跑到老爹酒店了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo, have you been at the Gaffer's home brew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.51,0:22:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我有，但那不是重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, but that's not the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是，佛罗多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, Frodo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了！ - 你要把它插在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Done! - You're supposed to stick it in the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:22:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 插好了呀 - 插在外面啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is in the ground. - Outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.76,0:23:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你出的主意！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博，当心那只飞龙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo, watch out for the dragon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞龙？说什么傻话，这儿有一千年没出现飞龙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense. There hasn't been a dragon in these parts for a thousand years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.72,0:23:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 - 再来一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was good. - Let's get another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里亚达克烈酒鹿，皮瑞格林图克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meriadoc Brandybuck and Peregrin Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might've known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,致词，比尔博！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech, Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,致词！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,致词！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的巴金斯家和波芬家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Bagginses and Boffins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克家和烈酒鹿家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tooks and Brandybucks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,万庐伯家、丘伯家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grubbs, Chubbs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹号者家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hornblowers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,博哲家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolgers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱腹家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracegirdles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和傲脚家 - 是傲足啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and Proudfoots. - Proudfeet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.80,0:24:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我111岁生日！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is my 111th birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.52,0:24:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是111年的时光太短了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But alas, eleventy-one years is far too short a time to live among…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想多跟你们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}such excellent and admirable Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只认识你们之中一小撮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know half of you half as well as I should like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.76,0:24:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我认识的人很少值得我喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I like less than half of you half as well as you deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.32,0:25:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have things to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事我拖了太久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've put this off far too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.04,0:25:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遣憾我要宣布宴会结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to announce this is the end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.20,0:25:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向大家道别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you all a very fond farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得这招很高明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you think that was terribly clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到他们的表情吗，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Gandalf. Did you see their faces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有很多神奇戒指，但是不该随便乱用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many magic rings in this world, and none of them should be used lightly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是开个玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a bit of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过就像平时一样，你说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're probably right, as usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会照顾佛罗多吧？ - 当然会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will keep an eye on Frodo, won't you? - Two eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力照顾他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As often as I can spare them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.40,0:26:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要把一切都留给他 - 那只戒指呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm leaving everything to him. - What about this ring of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.80,0:26:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那要留下来吗？ - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that staying too? - Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用信封装好放在壁炉上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in an envelope over there on the mantelpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对，等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wait, it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.20,0:26:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在我的口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}here in my pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.36,0:26:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪，不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that… Isn't that odd, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:26:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀，有何不可呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, after all, why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.44,0:27:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我何不留着呢？ - 你应该把戒指留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why shouldn't I keep it? - I think you should leave the ring behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.76,0:27:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这么困难吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so hard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.12,0:27:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我突然不想把它给别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it comes to it, I don't feel like parting with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.64,0:27:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我的，是我找到它的！它来到我身边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine. I found it! It came to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也没必要动肝火吧 - 我会动肝火，全是你的错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no need to get angry. - Well, if I'm angry, it's your fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.32,0:27:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.16,0:27:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的宝贝 - 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My precious. - Precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前也有别人这么叫过它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been called that before, but not by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的戒指，与你无关！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What business is it of yours what I do with my own things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只戒指你留着够久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've had that ring quite long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只想独吞它！ - 比尔博巴金斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want it for yourself! - Bilbo Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我当成一个江湖术士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not take me for some conjurer of cheap tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想抢你的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not trying to rob you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.36,0:28:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都认识这么久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your long years, we've been friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.28,0:28:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你像以前一样相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me as you once did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.76,0:28:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指一定要留给佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring must go to Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天色晚了，路还很长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late. The road is long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.80,0:28:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指还在你的口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ring is still in your pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.96,0:29:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替我的书想到一个结尾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought up an ending for my book:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,“他从此过着快乐的生活，直到寿终正寝”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And he lived happily ever after to the end of his days."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会的，老友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure you will, my dear friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.28,0:29:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，亲爱的比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, dear Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然路程尚遥远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road goes ever on and on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.76,0:29:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until our next meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.48,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我的，我一个人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine. My own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗中的谜语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddles in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.80,0:30:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.52,0:30:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.92,0:30:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, hasn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.24,0:30:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都说要离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked for so long about leaving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到他真的走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think he'd really do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.68,0:31:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博的戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo's ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去和精灵住在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone to stay with the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.48,0:31:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把袋底洞留给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's left you Bag End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.16,0:31:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他所有的财产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with all his possessions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.88,0:31:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指是你的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring is yours now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.40,0:31:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它藏起来 - 你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it somewhere out of sight. - Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.08,0:31:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一定要去办些事 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There are some things that I must see to. - What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有一些疑间一定要得到解答 - 你才刚到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Questions. Questions that need answering. - You've only just arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.68,0:31:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:32:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.68,0:32:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,“第二纪元的3434年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The year 3434 of the Second Age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是刚铎之王埃西铎的记载…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here follows the account of Isildur, High King of Gondor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.04,0:33:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及找到至尊魔戒的过程”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the finding of the Ring of Power."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.24,0:33:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我终于拿到手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It has come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只至尊魔戒将是我的镇国之宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The One Ring. It shall be an heirloom of my kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的后代将永远对它效忠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those who follow in my bloodline shall be bound to its fate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.56,0:33:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不容许魔戒受到任何损伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I will risk no hurt to the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.56,0:34:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is precious to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.96,0:34:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经过多少痛苦才得到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}though I buy it with great pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.72,0:34:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒环的刻痕逐渐褪色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The markings upon the band begin to fade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.24,0:34:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些赤焰般的文字现在全部消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The writing, which at first was as clear as red flame, has all but disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有火焰能让秘密显现”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secret now that only fire can tell."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.76,0:34:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.92,0:34:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.40,0:34:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯家族不住这里，他们都住在哈比屯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no Bagginses around here. They're all up in Hobbiton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.16,0:34:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿呵，酒瓶我来了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hey, Bottle I'm here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.68,0:34:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 疗愈我的心，淹没我的愁 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To heal my heart and drown my woe ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.04,0:35:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 下大雨刮大风 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Rain may fall and wind may blow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 路途仍然… ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But there still be… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.68,0:35:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 千里迢迢 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Many miles to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 雨声甜美 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Sweet is the sound of the pouring rain ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 山丘流到平原的潺潺小溪也温柔 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And the stream that falls From hill to plain ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.84,0:35:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不过清亮过雨声或小溪的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Better than rain or rippling brook ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.84,0:35:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是灌进图克肚里的啤酒 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is a mug of beer inside this Took ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.68,0:35:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔最近有很奇怪的人路过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been some strange folk crossing the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.96,0:35:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人族跟难看的他族人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwarves and others of a less than savory nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争正在酝酿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War is brewing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.32,0:35:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,山上已经遍布了半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mountains are fair teeming with goblins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都只是传说与童话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far-off tales and children's stories, that's all that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话越来越像老比尔博巴金斯，他是个狂人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beginning to sound like that old Bilbo Baggins. Cracked, he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.88,0:35:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的佛罗多大爷也要成为狂人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Mr. Frodo here, he's cracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.04,0:35:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还很自豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And proud of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯，老爹 - 干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheers, Gaffer. - Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.12,0:35:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住的地方以外都不关我们的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of our concern what goes on beyond our borders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去惹麻烦，麻烦就不会来惹你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your nose out of trouble, and no trouble'll come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家晚安 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, lads. - Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.44,0:36:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，金黄啤酒的甜蜜少女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweet maiden of the golden ale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.12,0:36:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你在跟谁甜言蜜捂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind who you're sweet-talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.68,0:36:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，山姆，罗丝认得出谁是白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Sam. Rosie knows an idiot when she sees one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.20,0:36:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.04,0:36:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安，山姆 - 晚安，佛罗多大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, Sam. - Good night, Mister Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有守密吗？它安全吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it secret? Is it safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手伸出来，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold out your hand, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很凉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.08,0:37:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.76,0:37:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有刻痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are markings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.44,0:37:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是精灵文，我看不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some form of Elvish. I can't read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.08,0:37:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少人看得懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are few who can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.24,0:37:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是魔多的古文字，我现在不可以念出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The language is that of Mordor, which I will not utter here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mordor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the common tongue, it says:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,“至尊戒，驭众戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"One Ring to rule them all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.96,0:37:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊戒，寻众戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Ring to find them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.48,0:38:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔戒至尊引众戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Ring to bring them all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁锢众戒黑暗中”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the darkness bind them."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the One Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.88,0:38:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是黑暗魔君索伦以末日火山的烈焰铸成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}forged by the Dark Lord Sauron in the fires of Mount Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎从索伦手中夺过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken by Isildur from the hand of Sauron himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.12,0:38:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在咕鲁的洞穴中 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In Gollum's cave. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.32,0:38:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博六十年来不动声色地持有至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 60 years, the Ring lay quiet in Bilbo's keeping…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因而延长了寿命，延迟了老化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}prolonging his life, delaying old age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.12,0:38:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是状况已经改变了，邪恶在魔多蠢蠢欲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no longer, Frodo. Evil is stirring in Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.68,0:38:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒被唤醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring has awoken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.32,0:38:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它听到主人的召唤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heard its master's call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.28,0:38:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他已经被消灭了，索伦已经被消灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was destroyed. Sauron was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.88,0:38:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.92,0:38:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦的灵魂没有死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit of Sauron endured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.44,0:39:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的生命和至尊魔戒紧紧相系，而至尊魔戒幸存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His life force is bound to the Ring, and the Ring survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君索伦回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron has returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的半兽人大军与日俱增{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Orcs have multiplied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在魔多也重建了要塞巴拉多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fortress at Barad-dur is rebuilt in the land of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.64,0:39:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦只需要这只戒指，就能让黑暗再度笼罩大地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron needs only this Ring to cover all the lands in a second darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在搜寻至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is seeking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.92,0:39:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,全心全意、不择手段地搜寻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeking it. All his thought is bent on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.00,0:39:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时至尊魔戒也渴望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the Ring yearns above all else…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到主人的手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return to the hand of its master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本为一体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.48,0:39:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒和黑暗魔君{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ring and the Dark Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.80,0:39:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.36,0:39:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能让他找到至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must never find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.48,0:39:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.84,0:39:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它藏起来，从此再也不提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put it away. We keep it hidden. We never speak of it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.36,0:39:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道它在这儿，对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows it's here, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.68,0:39:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.92,0:40:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人知道比尔博得到至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one other who knew that Bilbo had the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.56,0:40:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处在找咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked everywhere for the creature Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.84,0:40:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是魔君先找到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the enemy found him first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不晓得被拷打了多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how long they tortured him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在可怕的哀嚎和呻吟声中，他们听出两个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But amidst the endless screams and inane babble, they discerned two words:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.04,0:40:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯，他们会找到这里来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins. But that would lead them here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.84,0:40:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who goes there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.72,0:40:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿去，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.28,0:40:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去！ - 不行，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it! - No, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.56,0:40:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定要拿去！ - 你不能把魔戒给我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must take it! - You cannot offer me this ring!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.16,0:40:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要把它给你！ - 别引诱我，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm giving it to you! - Don't tempt me, Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare not take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.56,0:40:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,更无法保护它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even to keep it safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要了解，佛罗多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand, Frodo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.84,0:40:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望利用至尊魔戒行善事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would use this Ring from a desire to do good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.88,0:41:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是透过我，魔戒将释放无法想像的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But through me, it would wield a power too great and terrible to imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不能留在夏尔！ - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it cannot stay in the Shire! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.96,0:41:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.92,0:41:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What must I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.96,0:41:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定要赶快走 - 去哪里？我要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must leave. And leave quickly. - Where? Where do I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿，赶到布理村{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the Shire. Make for the village of Bree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.28,0:41:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,布理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你呢？ - 我会等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - I'll be waiting for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.52,0:41:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在跃马旅店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the inn of the Prancing Pony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔戒在那儿安全吗？ - 我不知道，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the Ring will be safe there? - I don't know, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法回答你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.64,0:41:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去见巫师长，他有智慧与力量，相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must see the head of my order. He is both wise and powerful. Trust me, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.12,0:41:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能用巴金斯这名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to leave the name of Baggins behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字在夏尔之外不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That name is not safe outside the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.36,0:42:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天赶路，别走大道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel only by day. And stay off the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.32,0:42:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以穿过农田{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can cut across country easily enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.00,0:42:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.60,0:42:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits really are amazing creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.84,0:42:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一个月就能了解他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can learn all that there is to know about their ways in a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一百年后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, after a hundred years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.48,0:42:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍然让你吃惊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can still surprise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.72,0:42:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶的山姆卫斯詹吉！你一直在偷听吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confound it all, Samwise Gamgee! Have you been eavesdropping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.40,0:42:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有偷听什么，我只是在窗外除草而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been dropping no eaves. Honest. I was cutting the grass under the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.08,0:42:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在除草未免太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little late for trimming the verge, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.68,0:42:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听到有人大声说话 - 你听到什么？快说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard raised voices. - What did you hear? Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.72,0:42:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到戒指、黑暗魔君和世界末日…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, I heard a good deal about a ring, a Dark Lord and the end of the world but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.68,0:42:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫大爷，别伤害我，别把我变成死的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mr. Gandalf, sir, don't hurt me. Don't turn me into anything unnatural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.16,0:43:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.00,0:43:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的用处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought of a better use for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.56,0:43:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，山姆卫斯，跟上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Samwise. Keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.04,0:43:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们千万要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.56,0:43:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔君有很多眼线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy has many spies in his service:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.56,0:43:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,包话飞鸟野兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birds, beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.72,0:43:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别戴上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never put it on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.32,0:43:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君的爪牙会被那种力量吸引来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the agents of the Dark Lord will be drawn to its power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.92,0:43:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，你要记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always remember, Frodo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.92,0:43:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒想要回到主人手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ring is trying to get back to its master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.44,0:43:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想要被找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.16,0:44:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.16,0:44:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要再跨一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I take one more step…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.76,0:44:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我离家最远的一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be the farthest away from home I've ever been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.84,0:44:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.80,0:44:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得比尔博老是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what Bilbo used to say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.20,0:44:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “旅行很危险，佛罗多” - “一旦你出了门…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "It's a dangerous business, Frodo." - "Going out your door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.16,0:44:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了路，如果你不专心看路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You step onto the road, and if you don't keep your feet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.76,0:45:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁晓得你会被带到哪里去”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no knowing where you might be swept off to."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.96,0:45:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.28,0:45:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,木精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wood-elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.12,0:45:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去白色要塞外的港湾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to the harbor beyond the White Towers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.20,0:45:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到灰港岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Grey Havens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.52,0:45:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要离开中土世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're leaving Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.76,0:45:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.88,0:45:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.68,0:45:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我觉得悲伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes me sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.08,0:46:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我躺在哪里，都有粗粗脏脏的根抵在我背上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere I lie there's a dirty great root sticking into my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.48,0:46:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut your eyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.40,0:46:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像你回到自己的床上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and imagine you're back in your own bed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.36,0:46:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有柔软的床垫跟舒适的羽毛枕头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a soft mattress and a lovely feather pillow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有用，佛罗多大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.44,0:46:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法在野地睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to be able to sleep out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.68,0:46:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆，我也没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.52,0:47:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日火山再度升起烟硝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke rises from the Mountain of Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.76,0:47:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour grows late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.60,0:47:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰袍巫师甘道夫赶到艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gandalf the Grey rides to Isengard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.40,0:47:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求我的建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeking my counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.04,0:47:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是为了这件事来找我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that is why you have come, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.20,0:47:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.80,0:47:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.16,0:47:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很榷定吗？ - 千真万确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are sure of this? - Beyond any doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.00,0:47:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒被发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the Ring of Power has been found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.48,0:47:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来一直在夏尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these long years, it was in the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.88,0:47:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在我眼前 - 你却没有发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Under my very nose. - Yet you did not have the wit to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.68,0:47:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你热爱的半身人烟草让你的思维呆滞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your love of the halfling's leaf has clearly slowed your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.80,0:47:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还来得及，还有时间对抗索伦的势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we still have time. Time enough to counter Sauron if we act quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.20,0:47:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.64,0:47:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们哪来的时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time do you think we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.72,0:47:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦的力量几乎已经完全恢复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron has regained much of his former strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.76,0:47:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他尚未完全转生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot yet take physical form…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.16,0:48:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的灵魂仍有强大魔力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his spirit has lost none of its potency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.56,0:48:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然被封在要塞中，但是他却无所不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concealed within his fortress, the Lord of Mordor sees all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.16,0:48:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的视线能穿透乌云、阴影、土地甚至肉体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His gaze pierces cloud, shadow, earth and flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of what I speak, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.68,0:48:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个被烈焰包围，没有眼皮的巨大眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Great Eye, lidless, wreathed in flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.92,0:48:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是索伦之眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye of Sauron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.92,0:48:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在聚集邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is gathering all evil to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.68,0:48:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快地，他会召集足够的兵力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very soon, he'll have summoned an army…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.36,0:48:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击中土世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}great enough for an assault upon Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.92,0:48:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这些？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.84,0:48:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.92,0:48:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.00,0:48:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真知晶球是个危险的工具，萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A palantir is a dangerous tool, Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.92,0:48:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.88,0:48:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要害怕使用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we fear to use it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.24,0:48:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的真知之石下落不明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not all accounted for, the lost Seeing-stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.40,0:49:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道还有谁也在看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not know who else may be watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.20,0:49:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间来不及了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour is later than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.12,0:49:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦的行动已经展开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron's forces are already moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.68,0:49:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那九个已经离开米那斯魔窟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nine have left Minas Morgul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.84,0:49:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那九个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在仲夏前夕跨越艾辛河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They crossed the River Isen on Midsummer's Eve…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.28,0:49:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装成黑骑士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}disguised as riders in black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.20,0:49:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们已经到了夏尔？ - 他们会找到至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've reached the Shire? - They will find the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.76,0:49:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀死它的持有者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kill the one who carries it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.48,0:49:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.56,0:49:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的以为哈比人能对抗索伦吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not seriously think that a Hobbit could contend with the will of Sauron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.72,0:49:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都对抗不了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are none who can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.04,0:49:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能逆着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the power of Mordor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.96,0:50:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔多的力量取得胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there can be no victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.56,0:50:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须加入他们，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must join with him, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.00,0:50:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须投靠索伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must join with Sauron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做才聪明，朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be wise, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.12,0:50:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告拆我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.80,0:50:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,智者萨鲁曼几时发疯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when did Saruman the Wise abandon reason for madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.88,0:51:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you the chance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.72,0:51:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,自愿帮助我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of aiding me willingly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.56,0:51:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你却宁愿选择受苦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have elected the way of pain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.04,0:51:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.12,0:51:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo? Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.36,0:51:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我跟丢你了 - 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought I'd lost you. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.76,0:51:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘道夫跟我说过 - 他说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just something Gandalf said. - What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.60,0:51:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,“紧跟着他，山姆卫斯詹吉”我会紧跟着你不放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't you lose him, Samwise Gamgee." And I don't mean to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在夏尔，会有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we're still in the Shire. What could possibly happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.36,0:52:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.60,0:52:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅里，是佛罗多巴金斯 - 哈嗓，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry, it's Frodo Baggins. - Hello, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.08,0:52:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.96,0:52:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.64,0:52:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the meaning of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.96,0:52:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们偷摘老农夫马嘎的菜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been into Farmer Maggot's crop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我滚出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.40,0:52:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚，臭小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my field!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我抓到，就要你们好看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know the devil if I catch up with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,生什么气嘛，不过两根红萝萄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why he's so upset. It's only a couple of carrots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.00,0:52:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几棵包心菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some cabbages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.32,0:52:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,和上礼拜偷的几袋马铃薯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those three bags of potatoes that we lifted last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.40,0:52:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有上上个礼拜的蘑菇 - 好了！皮聘，我是说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then the mushrooms the week before. - Yes, Pippin. My point is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.68,0:52:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太小题大作了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's clearly overreacting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.04,0:52:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.68,0:52:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像摔断了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've broken something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.80,0:53:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈酒鹿和图克家的人最会惹麻烦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust a Brandybuck and a Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.36,0:53:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？这是一条捷径耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? That was just a detour. A short cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.20,0:53:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪儿的捷径？ - 蘑菇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Short cut to what? - Mushrooms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.44,0:53:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大一朵哦，梅里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.60,0:53:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也有，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a nice one, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.84,0:53:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好躲起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should get off the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.56,0:53:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.12,0:53:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.32,0:53:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.12,0:55:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东东？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.00,0:55:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.36,0:55:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑骑士在找什么东西或是什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Black Rider was looking for something. Or someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.36,0:55:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.52,0:55:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.48,0:56:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要离开夏尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to leave the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.68,0:56:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟山姆要赶到布理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and I must get to Bree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.20,0:56:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没间题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.04,0:56:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴寇伯理渡口，跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucklebury Ferry. Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.64,0:56:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.12,0:56:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿！跟上来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.72,0:56:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.08,0:56:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆，快去松开绳子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the rope, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.44,0:56:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.72,0:56:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.44,0:56:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑！ - 快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:57:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.28,0:57:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！快！ - 跳呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Faster! - Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.28,0:57:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近的渡桥有多远？ - 烈酒桥，二十英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far to the nearest crossing? - The Brandywine Bridge. 20 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.08,0:57:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要什么？ - 我们要去跃马旅店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - We're heading for the Prancing Pony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.72,0:57:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人，四个哈比人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits. Four Hobbits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.68,0:58:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且老天，还离开你们夏尔，你们来布理有何贵干？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's more, out of the Shire by your talk. What business brings you to Bree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.24,0:58:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想投宿在旅店里，来干什么是我们的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wish to stay at the inn. Our business is our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.44,0:58:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧大爷，我不是故意找碴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, young sir. I meant no offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.16,0:58:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑后我就得多间一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job to ask questions after night fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.88,0:58:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说附近有怪人游荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's talk of strange folk abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.92,0:58:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点比较好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be too careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.76,0:58:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心看路！注意脚步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way! Watch where you're walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.76,0:58:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,（跃马旅店）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.28,0:59:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.96,0:59:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，贵客，需要什么服务吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, little masters. What can I do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想歇一晚，我们有哈比人住的舒适房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're seeking accommodation, we got some cozy Hobbit-sized rooms available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.24,0:59:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远都很乐意为小个儿们提供服务，怎么称呼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always proud to cater to the Little Folk, Mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.96,0:59:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,山下，我叫山下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underhill. My name's Underhill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.32,0:59:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山下 - 我们是灰袍巫师甘道夫的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Underhill, yes. - We're friends of Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.00,0:59:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能告诉他我们来了吗？ - 甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you tell him we've arrived? - Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.56,0:59:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.12,0:59:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.04,0:59:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得了，一个老头子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember. Elderly chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.44,0:59:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长长的灰胡子，尖尖的帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big grey beard, pointy hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.84,0:59:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年没见到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not seen him for six months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.44,0:59:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.92,1:00:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.36,1:00:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll be here. He'll come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.96,1:00:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.44,1:00:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.36,1:00:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友，这就是一品脱啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, my friend, is a pint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.04,1:00:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这么大杯的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes in pints?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.04,1:00:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也要一杯 - 你喝很多了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting one. - You got a whole half already!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.08,1:00:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了之后，那个人一直看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fellow's done nothing but stare at you since we arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.48,1:00:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在角落的那位，他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Man in the corner. Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.92,1:00:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个游侠，很危险，成天在荒野游荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of them Rangers. They're dangerous folk, wandering the Wilds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.60,1:00:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他的名字，但是这儿的人都叫他神行客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What his right name is, I've never heard, but around here he's known as Strider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.48,1:00:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,神行客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.76,1:01:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.44,1:01:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.32,1:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯？我认识呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins? Sure, I know a Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.36,1:01:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's over there. Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.44,1:01:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的表舅…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my second cousin, once removed on his mother's side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.64,1:01:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也同时是他的表…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my third cousin, twice removed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.44,1:01:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮聘！ - 稳住，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pippin! - Steady on, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.72,1:02:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躲不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.16,1:02:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在处空中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.88,1:02:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the void.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.24,1:02:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.68,1:02:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.16,1:02:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太惹人注意了，山下大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You draw far too much attention to yourself, "Mr. Underhill."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.72,1:02:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.88,1:02:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你小心点，你戴的不是小玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more caution from you. That is no trinket you carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么都没戴 - 是喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I carry nothing. - Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.68,1:03:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想，我也能不被看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can avoid being seen if I wish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.40,1:03:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是完全隐形却不是件易事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to disappear entirely, that is a rare gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.60,1:03:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是什么人？ - 你害怕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Are you frightened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.40,1:03:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.68,1:03:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕还不够怕，我知道谁在找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not nearly frightened enough. I know what hunts you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.60,1:03:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他！否则我让你好看，长腿人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go! Or I'll have you, Longshanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.80,1:03:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哈比人，你很有胆量，但是这救不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a stout heart, little Hobbit. But that will not save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.08,1:03:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再等巫师了，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can no longer wait for the wizard, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.24,1:03:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.88,1:04:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.56,1:05:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾经是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were once Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.88,1:05:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类伟大的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great kings of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.64,1:05:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是骗子索伦给他们九只魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Sauron the Deceiver gave to them nine rings of power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们利欲熏心，毫不让疑地收下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blinded by their greed, they took them without question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.68,1:05:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果一一沉沦于黑暗力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one, falling into darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.20,1:05:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为黑暗魔君的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they are slaves to his will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是戒灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the Nazgul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.00,1:05:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,介于生与死之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ringwraiths. Neither living nor dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.48,1:05:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随时感受到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At all times they feel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.08,1:05:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔戒的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the presence of the Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.20,1:05:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,被至尊魔戒吸引着，他们会一直追杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drawn to the power of the One. They will never stop hunting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.72,1:05:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要带我们去哪儿？ - 荒野{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you taking us? - Into the Wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.88,1:05:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道神行客是甘道夫的朋友？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know this Strider is a friend of Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.12,1:06:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想魔君的仆役看起来会更体面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a servant of the enemy would look fairer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.32,1:06:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更令人厌恶 - 他够让人厌恶了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and feel fouler. - He's foul enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.84,1:06:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法，只能相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice but to trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要带我们去哪里？ - 瑞文戴尔，詹吉大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But where is he leading us? - To Rivendell, Master Gamgee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.72,1:06:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 精灵王爱隆的家 - 你们听到吗？瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the house of Elrond. - Did you hear that? Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.56,1:06:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去见精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to see the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.96,1:06:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位，天黑才能歇脚 - 那早餐怎么办呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen, we do not stop till nightfall. - What about breakfast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.36,1:06:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们吃过了 - 才吃过一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've already had it. - We've had one, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.24,1:06:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第二顿早餐呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about second breakfast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.88,1:06:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮聘，他不知道有第二顿早餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think he knows about second breakfast, Pip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.28,1:07:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早午餐呢？午餐？下午茶？晚餐？宵夜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about elevenses? Luncheon? Afternoon tea? Dinner? Supper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.68,1:07:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他应该都知道吧？ - 我看不见得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows about them, doesn't he? - I wouldn't count on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.32,1:07:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮聘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.48,1:07:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哈比人，她们吃什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they eat when they can't get Hobbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.76,1:08:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.68,1:08:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所歌颂的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman you sing of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.68,1:08:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是露西安小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Tis the lady of Luthien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.28,1:08:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给凡人贝伦的精灵少女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Elf-maiden who gave her love to Beren, a mortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.28,1:08:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.60,1:08:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.16,1:08:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一下吧，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.76,1:09:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾辛格遵从您的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of Isengard is at your command…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.04,1:09:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球君主索伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron, Lord of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.80,1:09:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我召集一支魔多大军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build me an army worthy of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人，魔多有什么命令？魔眼有什么吩咐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What orders from Mordor, my lord? What does the Eye command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.12,1:09:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.64,1:10:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些树非常坚韧，主人，树根很深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trees are strong, my lord. Their roots go deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.64,1:10:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都拉倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip them all down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.92,1:10:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是风云顶缭望台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the great watchtower of Amon Sul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.52,1:10:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在这里过夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall rest here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.84,1:11:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些给你们，一定要随身佩带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are for you. Keep them close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.52,1:11:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to have a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.36,1:11:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蕃茄熟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tomato's burst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.20,1:11:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一些培根好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have some bacon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.32,1:11:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆，吃点蕃茄吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a tomato, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.64,1:11:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在干嘛？ - 煎蕃茄、香肠和培根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing?! - Tomatoes, sausages, nice crispy bacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.52,1:11:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我替你留了一些，佛罗多大爷 - 笨蛋，快把火熄掉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We saved some for you, Mr. Frodo. - Put it out, you fools!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.40,1:11:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快熄掉！ - 这下可好了，蕃茄上都是灰烬！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it out! - That's nice! Ash on my tomatoes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.88,1:11:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.12,1:12:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后，恶魔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back, you devils!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.04,1:14:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.24,1:14:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,神行客！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.00,1:14:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快救救他，神行客 - 他被魔窟剑刺中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help him, Strider. - He's been stabbed by a Morgul blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.96,1:15:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救不了他，精灵才有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beyond my skill to heal. He needs Elvish medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.48,1:15:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.76,1:15:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,离瑞文戴尔还有六天行程！他撑不下去的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're six days from Rivendell! He'll never make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.88,1:15:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要撑下去，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.08,1:15:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.40,1:17:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，佛罗多，是比尔博大爷的食人妖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Frodo. It's Mr. Bilbo's trolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.60,1:18:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷？他好冰冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frodo? He's going cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.36,1:18:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会死吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he going to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.32,1:18:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在进入幽界，很快也会成为死灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's passing into the Shadow World. He'll soon become a Wraith like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.36,1:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们就在附近 - 山姆，你知道阿夕拉斯草吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're close. - Sam, do you know the Athelas plant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.36,1:18:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿夕拉斯？ - 又叫王之剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Athelas? - Kingsfoil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.04,1:18:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,王之剑，那是一种草药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kingsfoil, aye, it's a weed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.28,1:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那能阻缓毒性发作，快去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may help to slow the poisoning. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.84,1:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？游侠竟然毫无防备？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? A Ranger caught off his guard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.88,1:19:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.88,1:19:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我是亚玟，我来帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Arwen… I've come to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.44,1:19:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 听到我的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear my voice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.52,1:19:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就回到光亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.72,1:19:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.24,1:19:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.32,1:19:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是个精灵 - 他快失去意识了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's an Elf. - He's fading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.12,1:19:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撑不久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要带他去找我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must get him to my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.88,1:19:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找了你两天 - 你们要带他去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've been looking for you for two days. - Where are you taking him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.96,1:19:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,五名戒灵跟着你，我不知道另外四个在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are five Wraiths behind you. Where the other four are, I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.16,1:19:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 陪着哈比人，我会来接你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with the Hobbits… I'll send horses for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.80,1:19:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我骑得比较快，我来载他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the faster rider… I'll take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.28,1:20:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 路上太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Road is too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.88,1:20:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.36,1:20:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 如果我能渡河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get across the river…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.60,1:20:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我族人的力量就可以保护他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the power of my people will protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.16,1:20:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fear them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.64,1:20:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚玟…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arwen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.24,1:20:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼命骑，别回头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ride hard. Don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.48,1:20:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？戒灵还在追杀他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?! Those Wraiths are still out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.48,1:22:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把半身人交给我，女精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up the halfling, She-Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.20,1:22:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要他，尽管来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want him, come and claim him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.60,1:23:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.40,1:23:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，别死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.84,1:23:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，别放弃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, don't give in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.36,1:23:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.28,1:23:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请赐给我力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What grace is given me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.44,1:23:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他度过灾厄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let it pass to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.48,1:24:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他免于死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him be spared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.28,1:24:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.80,1:24:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在哪里？ - 你在爱隆王的皇宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where am I? - You are in the house of Elrond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.36,1:24:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道，现在是10月24日早上10点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is 10:00 in the morning on October 24th, if you want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.80,1:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘道夫！ - 是的，我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gandalf! - Yes, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.32,1:24:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有死算你幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're lucky to be here too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.00,1:24:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几小时你就没救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few more hours and you would have been beyond our aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.20,1:24:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的生命力真强，亲爱的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have some strength in you, my dear Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.96,1:24:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.40,1:25:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么没去找我们？ - 对不起，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you meet us? - I am sorry, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.52,1:25:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事耽搁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was delayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.16,1:25:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能随便和萨鲁曼绝交{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friendship with Saruman is not lightly thrown aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.56,1:25:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再杭拒了，没有用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ill turn deserves another. It is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.52,1:25:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不投靠魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace the power of the Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.88,1:25:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等着灭亡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or embrace your own destruction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.68,1:25:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上只有一个魔戒之王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one Lord of the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.76,1:25:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他能够驾驭魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one who can bend it to his will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.64,1:25:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会和你分享权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he does not share power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.92,1:26:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你选择了死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have chosen death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.32,1:26:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫，怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.08,1:26:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.60,1:26:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.84,1:26:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆！ - 你终于醒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Bless you, you're awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.44,1:26:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆一直守在你身逢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam has hardly left your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.44,1:26:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好担心你，对吧，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were that worried about you. Weren't we, Mr. Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.92,1:26:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好有爱隆王，你开始痊愈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the skills of Lord Elrond, you're beginning to mend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.56,1:26:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临瑞文戴尔，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Rivendell, Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.24,1:27:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比尔博！ - 佛罗多，好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bilbo! - Hello, Frodo, my lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.72,1:27:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.28,1:27:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,“去而复返：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There and Back Again:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.40,1:27:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人的故事，比尔博巴金斯著”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hobbit's Tale, by Bilbo Baggins."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.28,1:27:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 我想再回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is wonderful. - I meant to go back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.16,1:27:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在幽暗密林的小径上徜徉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wonder at the powers of Mirkwood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.36,1:27:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,探访长湖镇…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}visit Lake-town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.88,1:28:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看一眼孤山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}see the Lonely Mountain again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.72,1:28:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我终于年老力衰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But age, it seems, has finally caught up with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.88,1:28:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,（夏尔）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.80,1:28:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.96,1:28:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就幻想能到别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent all my childhood pretending I was off somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.40,1:28:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一起去冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off with you, on one of your adventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.92,1:28:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我自己的冒险却完全不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my own adventure turned out to be quite different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.76,1:28:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你不一样，比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you, Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.16,1:28:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.56,1:28:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我遗忘了什么？ - 这么快就打包？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, what have I forgotten? - Packed already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.28,1:29:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,越早准备越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm in being prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.28,1:29:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你想看精灵 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you wanted to see the Elves. - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.08,1:29:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想看得不得了 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More than anything. - I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.12,1:29:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.84,1:29:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们照甘道夫说的做了，不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what Gandalf wanted, didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.64,1:29:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把魔戒带到瑞文戴尔，我觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the Ring this far, to Rivendell. And I thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.52,1:29:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤快好了，我们也要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as how you're on the mend, we'd be off soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.04,1:29:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.92,1:29:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.12,1:29:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们达成任务了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what we set out to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.40,1:29:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒在这儿很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring will be safe in Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.12,1:29:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ready to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.16,1:29:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的力气恢复了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His strength returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.44,1:29:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的伤永远无法痊愈，一辈子都会跟着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wound will never fully heal. He will carry it the rest of his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.72,1:29:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet to have come so far still bearing the Ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.44,1:29:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哈比人证明了他能抗拒魔戒的诱惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hobbit has shown extraordinary resilience to its evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.36,1:30:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不该扛下这份重担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a burden he should never have had to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.92,1:30:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛罗多已经尽力了 - 魔君正在蠢蠢欲动，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can ask no more of Frodo. - Gandalf, the enemy is moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.56,1:30:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦的大军在东方集结，他的邪眼正盯着瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron's forces are massing in the East. His Eye is fixed on Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我说过，萨鲁曼已经背叛我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Saruman, you tell me, has betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.40,1:30:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的盟友越来越少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our list of allies grows thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.36,1:30:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的恶行不只如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His treachery runs deeper than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.36,1:30:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以邪恶的技术把半兽人和妖精混在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By foul craft, Saruman has crossed Orcs with Goblin-men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.20,1:30:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在艾辛格的洞窟培育一支军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breeding an army in the caverns of Isengard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.96,1:30:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支能在白天行军千里的劲旅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An army that can move in sunlight and cover great distance at speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.76,1:30:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼要来抢夺至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saruman is coming for the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.56,1:30:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵无法抵抗这股邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This evil cannot be concealed by the power of the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.84,1:30:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法同时对抗魔多和艾辛格！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not have the strength to fight both Mordor and Isengard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.04,1:30:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.48,1:30:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒不能留在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ring cannot stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.56,1:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这危机是整个中土世界的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This peril belongs to all Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.00,1:31:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须决定如何结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must decide now how to end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.80,1:31:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵的时代过去了，迁移到别处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time of the Elves is over. My people are leaving these shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.04,1:31:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了你们要向谁求救？矮人族吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will you look to when we've gone? The Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.80,1:31:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都躲在山洞挖宝藏，一点都不关心别人的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hide in mountains seeking riches. They care not for the troubles of others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.52,1:31:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把希望放在人类身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is in Men that we must place our hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.76,1:31:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.28,1:31:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类太脆弱了，他们没有希望了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men are weak. The race of Men is failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.76,1:31:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,努曼诺尔人的血液不再纯正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood of Numenor is all but spent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.93,1:31:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的骄傲和荣耀早被遗忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}its pride and dignity forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.52,1:31:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔戒会幸存，都是人类的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is because of Men the Ring survives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.16,1:31:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我也在场，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.48,1:31:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千年前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there 3000 years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.12,1:32:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎取走至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Isildur took the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.76,1:32:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类屈服于诱惑的那天，我也在场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there the day the strength of Men failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.16,1:32:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎，快！跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isildur, hurry! Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.32,1:32:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带埃西铎来到末日火山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I led Isildur into the heart of Mount Doom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.16,1:32:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在那里才能摧毁至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the Ring was forged, the one place it could be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.92,1:32:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它丢进烈焰中！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast it into the fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.64,1:32:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毁了它！ - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Destroy it! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.80,1:32:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isildur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.44,1:32:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天就该结束一切，但是邪恶却让它存活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have ended that day, but evil was allowed to endure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.32,1:32:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎把至尊魔戒占为己有，皇室血脉就此断绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isildur kept the Ring. The line of kings is broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.44,1:32:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的世界早已失去力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no strength left in the world of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.32,1:33:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们群龙无首，四处流窜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scattered, divided, leaderless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.71,1:33:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人能让他们团结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one who could unite them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.32,1:33:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人能继承刚铎王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One who could reclaim the throne of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.40,1:33:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他早就放弃王位了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned from that path a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.36,1:33:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选择自我放逐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has chosen exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.52,1:33:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.76,1:33:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎南方来的人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of the South are welcome here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.48,1:33:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 我是灰袍巫师甘道夫的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I am a friend to Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为了共同的目的来到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are here on common purpose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.68,1:34:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.32,1:34:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳希尔圣剑的碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shards of Narsil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.72,1:34:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把利刀砍断索伦的手指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade that cut the Ring from Sauron's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.08,1:34:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是很说利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.24,1:34:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在只是残缺的传家宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no more than a broken heirloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.12,1:35:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么害怕过去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you fear the past?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.04,1:35:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你是埃西铎的后代，但并不是埃西铎本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Isildur's heir, not Isildur himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.64,1:35:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会重蹈他的覆辙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not bound to his fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.60,1:35:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他流着一样的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same blood flows in my veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.60,1:35:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样的软弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.84,1:35:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时代即将来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.80,1:35:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会面对同样的邪恶，然后打败它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will face the same evil. And you will defeat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.48,1:35:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 邪恶的力量并没有征服我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shadow does not hold sway yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.88,1:35:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你我还没被征服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not over you… not over me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.84,1:36:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 你记得我们第一次见面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when we first met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.60,1:36:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我以为我是走进了一个梦境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I had strayed into a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.68,1:36:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 过了这么多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long years have passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.92,1:36:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初你没有现在的担忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not have the cares you carry now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.72,1:36:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 你还记得我当初说什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what I told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.80,1:36:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你愿意嫁给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd bind yourself to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.56,1:36:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃精灵长生不死的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}forsaking the immortal life of your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.60,1:36:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍愿意这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to that I hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.76,1:36:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿和你共度一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather share one lifetime with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.60,1:36:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不愿意面对永生不死的孤寂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than face all the Ages of this world alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.24,1:37:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择成为凡人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose a mortal life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.04,1:37:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能给我这个 - 这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cannot give me this. - It is mine to give to whom I will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.48,1:37:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是我的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.84,1:37:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自远方的陌生人和老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangers from distant lands, friends of old…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.72,1:37:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被召集来商量如何对抗魔多的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been summoned here to answer the threat of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.32,1:37:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土世界正面临灭亡的命运，无人能幸免{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle-earth stands upon the brink of destruction. None can escape it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.40,1:37:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不图结一心就会遭到毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will unite, or you will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.16,1:37:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的种族都无法幸免{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each race is bound to this fate, this one doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.28,1:38:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，把魔戒拿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring forth the Ring, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.84,1:38:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.04,1:38:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在梦中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.92,1:38:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到东方的天空变暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the eastern sky grow dark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.12,1:38:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是西方仍有微光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the West a pale light lingered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.76,1:38:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个声音呼喊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A voice was crying:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.80,1:38:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,“你的末日近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your doom is near at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.72,1:38:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎的祸害找到了”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isildur's Bane is found."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.52,1:38:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃西铎的祸害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isildur's Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.88,1:39:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,波罗莫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boromir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.32,1:39:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伊姆拉崔，从未有人胆敢用那种语言吐出片语只字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before has any voice uttered the words of that tongue here in Imladris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.32,1:39:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢请您谅解，爱隆君主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not ask your pardon, Master Elrond…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.24,1:39:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了魔多的黑语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Black Speech of Mordor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.64,1:39:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而将来这可能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}may yet be heard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.28,1:39:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西方每一个角落都听得到！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every corner of the West!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.36,1:39:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这魔戒是彻底的邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring is altogether evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.36,1:39:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.48,1:39:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个给魔多敌人的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift to the foes of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.16,1:39:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不利用这只魔戒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not use this Ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.48,1:39:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲是刚铎的宰相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long has my father, the Steward of Gondor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.44,1:39:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直奋力和魔多抗争，我们流着鲜血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}kept the forces of Mordor at bay. By the blood of our people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.04,1:39:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你们的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are your lands kept safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.04,1:40:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把敌人的武器交给刚铎，让我们利用它来对抗邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Gondor the weapon of the enemy. Let us use it against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.64,1:40:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法驾驭它，谁都不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot wield it. None of us can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.96,1:40:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒的主人是索伦，没有第二个主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The One Ring answers to Sauron alone. It has no other master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.24,1:40:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,区区一个游侠懂什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would a Ranger know of this matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.08,1:40:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只是普通的游侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no mere Ranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.04,1:40:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是亚拉冈，亚拉松之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is Aragorn, son of Arathorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.24,1:40:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要对他效忠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe him your allegiance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.24,1:40:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.96,1:40:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是埃西铎的后代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Isildur's heir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.08,1:40:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是刚铎的王位继承人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And heir to the throne of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.96,1:40:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 坐下来，勒苟拉斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Legolas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.72,1:40:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚铎没有国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gondor has no king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.44,1:40:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚铎也不需要国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gondor needs no king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.80,1:41:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈说的对，魔戒不能利用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn is right. We cannot use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.48,1:41:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有一个选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have only one choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.20,1:41:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒一定要摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.80,1:41:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还等什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.48,1:41:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,金灵，葛罗音之子，在场的任何武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring cannot be destroyed, Gimli, son of Gloin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.72,1:41:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都无法摧毁魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by any craft that we here possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.48,1:41:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔戒是末日火山的烈焰铸成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring was made in the fires of Mount Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.80,1:41:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只有在那儿才能摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only there can it be unmade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.72,1:41:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要深入魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be taken deep into Mordor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.52,1:41:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把魔戒丢到末日火山的烈焰中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cast back into the fiery chasm from whence it came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.48,1:42:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们其中一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.00,1:42:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.08,1:42:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样闯进魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One does not simply walk into Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.72,1:42:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了有半兽人看守黑色大门外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its Black Gates are guarded by more than just Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.16,1:42:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有永不松懈的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is evil there that does not sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.52,1:42:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦的邪眼更是虎视耽耽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Great Eye is ever-watchful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.52,1:42:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一片死寂的荒原{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a barren wasteland…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.76,1:42:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,布满烈焰、灰烬和尘埃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}riddled with fire, and ash and dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.56,1:42:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是空中就充满致命毒气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very air you breathe is a poisonous fume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.60,1:42:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算有千军万马也办不到，这真荒唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with 10, 000 men could you do this. It is folly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.12,1:42:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有听到爱隆王说的话吗？魔戒一定要毁灭掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard nothing Lord Elrond has said? The Ring must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.80,1:42:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你认为该由你来完成啰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suppose you think you are the one to do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.56,1:42:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果失败了，魔戒被索伦抢回去怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we fail, what then? What happens when Sauron takes back what is his?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.44,1:42:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不容许魔戒落入精灵手中！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be dead before I see the Ring in the hands of an Elf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.72,1:43:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵都不可靠！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never trust an Elf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.40,1:43:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.40,1:43:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里吵嘴的时候，索伦的力量正在增强！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you bicker amongst yourselves, Sauron's power grows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.56,1:43:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人躲得过！每个人都会遭到毁灭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None can escape it! You'll all be destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.20,1:43:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.40,1:43:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.76,1:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意把魔戒带到魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take the Ring to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.92,1:43:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.32,1:44:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认得路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.16,1:44:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意协助你，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will help you bear this burden, Frodo Baggins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.64,1:44:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你愿背负重担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as it is yours to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.16,1:44:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意牺牲性命保护你的安危{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If by my life or death I can protect you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.56,1:44:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的剑会保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.64,1:44:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的弓箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have my bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.32,1:44:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我的斧头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my axe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.80,1:44:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背负着大家的命运，小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry the fates of us all, little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.80,1:44:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是大家的决定…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is indeed the will of the Council…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.96,1:44:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚铎也会支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Gondor will see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.00,1:44:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷到哪儿我都要跟去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo's not going anywhere without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.37,1:44:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是很难拆散你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is hardly possible to separate you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.96,1:45:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你没份参加的秘密会议，你都来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even when he is summoned to a secret Council and you are not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.44,1:45:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也要跟去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.36,1:45:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你把我们五花大绑送回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to send us home tied up in a sack to stop us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.36,1:45:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你需要聪明人来完成这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you need people of intelligence on this sort of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.04,1:45:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.56,1:45:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.48,1:45:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.40,1:45:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一个就不合格，皮聘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that rules you out, Pip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.64,1:45:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,九名同伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine companions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.36,1:45:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.52,1:45:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是魔戒远征队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall be the Fellowship of the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.20,1:45:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.28,1:45:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.10,1:46:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想保护她的孩子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to protect her child…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.50,1:46:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为你在瑞文戴尔会很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she thought in Rivendell you would be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.46,1:46:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的母亲内心深处明白，你一辈子都躲不过纠缠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her heart, your mother knew you'd be hunted all your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.42,1:46:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃脱不了你的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you'd never escape your fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.66,1:46:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵的技术能够重新铸造人皇的剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skill of the Elves can reforge the sword of kings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.70,1:46:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只有你有力量能够运用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only you have the power to wield it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.66,1:46:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要那个力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.30,1:46:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never wanted it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.30,1:46:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是皇家血脉最后的传人，无人能代替{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the last of that bloodline. There is no other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.42,1:47:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老剑，刺针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old sword! Sting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.98,1:47:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take it. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.66,1:47:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好轻哦 - 没错，精灵铸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so light. - Yes. Made by the Elves, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.22,1:47:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人接近，剑身就会发亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade glows blue when Orcs are close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.62,1:47:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来你就知道要格外小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's times like that, my lad, when you have to be extra careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.42,1:47:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿更棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a pretty thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.30,1:47:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘银{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mithril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.38,1:47:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻若鸿毛、韧如龙麟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As light as a feather, and as hard as dragon scales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.98,1:47:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看着你穿上，快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see you put it on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.26,1:47:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.58,1:47:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should very much like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.70,1:47:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把它握在手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hold it again, one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.10,1:48:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉把你卷进这件事，孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I brought this upon you, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.10,1:48:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你扛这重担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that you must carry this burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.70,1:48:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这一切都感到很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.82,1:48:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,持戒者准备出发到末日火山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring-bearer is setting out on the Quest of Mount Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.30,1:48:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他一起旅行的各位不受任何誓言…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On you who travel with him, no oath…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.14,1:48:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何承诺约束，随时可以中断旅程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor bond is laid to go further than you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.66,1:49:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会了，坚持你们的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell. Hold to your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.66,1:49:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿全体精灵与人类…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the blessings of Elves and Men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.14,1:49:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,与自由之民的祝福跟随着你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all Free Folk go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.82,1:49:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,远征队等待持戒者启程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fellowship awaits the Ring-bearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.34,1:49:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫，魔多是往左还是往右？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mordor, Gandalf, is it left or right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.38,1:49:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.82,1:51:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向迷雾山脉以西走四十天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must hold to this course, west of the Misty Mountains, for 40 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.46,1:51:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话就能赶到洛汗隘口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our luck holds, the Gap of Rohan will still be open to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.42,1:51:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那儿往东走到魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From there, our road turns east to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.18,1:51:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,二，一，五，好！非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, one, five. Good! Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.82,1:51:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚步要快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.06,1:51:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好帅哦，皮聘 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look good, Pippin. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.62,1:51:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.38,1:51:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你们都不问我的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone was to ask for my opinion, which I note they're not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.38,1:51:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是要说我们在绕远路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we were taking the long way 'round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.62,1:51:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫，我们可以穿过摩瑞亚矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf, we could pass through the Mines of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.34,1:51:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表哥巴林会以皇家礼节热烈欢迎我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cousin Balin would give us a royal welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.42,1:51:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，金灵，别无选择才能走摩瑞亚矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I would not take the road through Moria unless I had no other choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.02,1:51:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.90,1:51:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉住他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.86,1:51:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏尔万岁！ - 把他压住，梅里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For the Shire! - Hold him. Hold him down, Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.86,1:52:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, that's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.98,1:52:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住我了！你抓住我了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got my arm! You've got my arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.06,1:52:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 没什么，只是一朵乌云{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - Nothing. It's just a wisp of cloud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.90,1:52:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎着风…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.86,1:52:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,却移动得很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 登兰德的乌鸦！ - 快躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crebain from Dunland! - Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.14,1:52:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！ - 躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.30,1:52:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼的眼线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spies of Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.78,1:53:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,南方的路受到监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The passage south is being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.18,1:53:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要攀越卡兰拉斯山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must take the Pass of Caradhras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.14,1:53:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.82,1:53:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boromir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.34,1:53:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受尽了恐惧和疑虑的折磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a strange fate that we should suffer so much fear and doubt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.74,1:53:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了这小玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over so small a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.10,1:53:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小小的玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a little thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.26,1:53:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,波罗莫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boromir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.34,1:53:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把魔戒还给佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the Ring to Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.86,1:54:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.62,1:54:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.02,1:54:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫，你想带领他们越过卡兰拉斯山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Gandalf, you try to lead them over Caradhras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.94,1:54:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是失败，你要到哪儿去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that fails, where then will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.82,1:55:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你被高山峻岭打败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the mountain defeats you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.98,1:55:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯冒更大的危险吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you risk a more dangerous road?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.82,1:55:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气中有可怕的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a fell voice on the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.82,1:55:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是萨鲁曼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Saruman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.22,1:55:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想造成山崩！我们一定要回头，甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to bring down the mountain! Gandalf, we must turn back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.10,1:55:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.38,1:56:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要离开山顶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must get off the mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.70,1:56:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶到洛汗隘口，走西路到我的城市！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make for the Gap of Rohan, and take the west road to my city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.22,1:56:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛汗隘口离艾辛格太近了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gap of Rohan takes us too close to Isengard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.82,1:57:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面走不成就走下面吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot pass over a mountain. Let us go under it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.74,1:57:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们穿过摩瑞亚矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us go through the Mines of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.42,1:57:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚，你很怕穿过矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moria. You fear to go into those mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.90,1:57:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人太贪心，挖得太深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dwarves delved too greedily and too deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.74,1:57:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们在凯撒督姆的黑暗中唤醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they awoke in the darkness of Khazad-dum:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.94,1:57:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的炎魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadow and flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.78,1:57:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让魔戒持有者决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the Ring-bearer decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.18,1:57:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能在这里逗留！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.54,1:57:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈比人会葬身于此！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be the death of the Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.50,1:57:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.22,1:57:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿过矿坑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will go through the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.86,1:57:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.38,1:58:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，过来帮个老人吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, come and help an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.82,1:58:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肩膀还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your shoulder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.22,1:58:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比之前好多了 - 魔戒呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better than it was. - And the Ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.06,1:58:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到那股力量越来越强大了，对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel its power growing, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.02,1:58:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感觉到了，你一定要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've felt it too. You must be careful now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.42,1:58:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,远征队之外的邪恶会被召唤而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil will be drawn to you from outside the Fellowship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.46,1:58:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,远征队之内的，恐怕也会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I fear, from within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.66,1:58:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能相信谁呢？ - 你一定要相信你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who then do I trust? - You must trust yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.02,1:58:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你本身的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust your own strengths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.06,1:58:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 这世界有许多不同的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - There are many powers in this world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.78,1:58:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有善有恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for good or for evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.06,1:58:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些力量比我进强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are greater than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.90,1:58:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些我也还没测试过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And against some I have not yet been tested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.94,1:58:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚矿坑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.98,1:58:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,之墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.78,1:59:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人大门关闭的时候是隐形的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwarf doors are invisible when closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.98,1:59:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，精灵，如果忘记秘密了，连主人自己都找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Gimli, their own masters cannot find them if their secrets are forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.78,1:59:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不觉得意外？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't that surprise me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.26,1:59:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.86,1:59:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊希尔丁金屑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ithildin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.86,1:59:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只会反射星光和月光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It mirrors only starlight and moonlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.26,1:59:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面窝着：“都灵之门、摩瑞亚之主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reads, "The Doors of Durin, Lord of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.94,1:59:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开口说，朋友，然后进入” - 那是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Speak, friend, and enter." - What do you suppose that means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.78,1:59:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单，如果是朋友，说出暗语门就开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple. If you are a friend, you speak the password and the doors will open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.30,2:00:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有动静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.46,2:00:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经很熟悉精灵人类和半兽人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once knew every spell in all the tongues of Elves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.94,2:00:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有语言中的咒捂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.02,2:00:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.50,2:00:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的头撞门，，皮瑞格林图克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock your head against these doors, Peregrin Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.94,2:00:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那还不够撞碎这扇门…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that does not shatter them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.14,2:00:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不要用蠢问题干扰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am allowed a little peace from foolish questions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.02,2:00:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量想出暗语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will try to find the opening words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.30,2:01:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马儿不能进入矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mines are no place for a pony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.14,2:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就算像比尔一样勇敢也不行 - 再见了，比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Even one so brave as Bill. - Bye-bye, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.42,2:01:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧，比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Bill. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.74,2:01:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心，她知道路回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Sam, he knows the way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.10,2:01:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not disturb the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.86,2:01:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，没用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.42,2:01:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个谜语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a riddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.34,2:01:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开口说“朋友”，然后进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Speak friend and enter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.86,2:01:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友的精灵话怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the Elvish word for "friend"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.18,2:01:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mellon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.54,2:02:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会见识到矮人族著名的热情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, Master Elf, you will enjoy the fabled hospitality of the Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.90,2:02:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊熊的火焰、清谅的啤酒，有大块的烤肉吃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaring fires, malt beer, ripe meat off the bone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.10,2:02:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我表哥巴林的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, my friend, is the home of my cousin Balin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.54,2:02:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们所渭的矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they call it a mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.14,2:02:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿坑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.14,2:02:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是矿坑，这是坟墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no mine. It's a tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.62,2:02:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.46,2:02:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.74,2:02:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goblins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.22,2:02:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去洛汗隘口，不该来这儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make for the Gap of Rohan. We should never have come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.54,2:03:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get out of here. Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.94,2:03:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛罗多！ - 救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frodo! - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.54,2:03:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,神行客！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.30,2:03:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救我！ - 在这儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Get off him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.26,2:03:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.74,2:03:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.10,2:03:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去矿坑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the mines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.38,2:03:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 勒苟拉斯！ - 快进去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Legolas! - Into the cave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.86,2:04:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.50,2:04:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下一个选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We now have but one choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.30,2:04:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要穿过黑暗的摩瑞亚矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must face the long dark of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.42,2:04:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家要提高警觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be on your guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.62,2:04:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个黑暗的地底世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are older and fouler things than Orcs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.22,2:04:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有比半兽人更可怕的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the deep places of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.74,2:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静，要走四天才能到另一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quietly now. It's a four-day journey to the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.86,2:04:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们不会惊动什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us hope that our presence may go unnoticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.50,2:05:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚的财富不在于金矿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wealth of Moria was not in gold…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.38,2:05:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或珠宝…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or jewels…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.98,2:05:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是秘银{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but mithril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.38,2:06:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博有一件秘银圈罩衫，是索林给他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo had a shirt of mithril rings that Thorin gave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.50,2:06:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值得献给人皇的礼物 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, that was a kingly gift. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.62,2:06:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没跟他说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.70,2:06:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件罩衫比整座夏尔更值钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but its worth was greater than the value of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.14,2:06:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.18,2:07:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得这地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no memory of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.18,2:07:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们迷路了吗？ - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we lost? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.86,2:07:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该迷路了 - 甘道夫正在想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we are. - Gandalf's thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.54,2:07:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅里？ - 干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.22,2:07:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.54,2:07:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下面有动静 - 那是咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's something down there. - It's Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.22,2:07:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咕鲁 - 他跟了我们三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gollum? - He's been following us for three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.54,2:07:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他从巴拉多的地牢逃出来？ - 逃出…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He escaped the dungeons of Barad-dur? - Escaped…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.38,2:07:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被放出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or was set loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.54,2:07:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在魔戒带他来到这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the Ring has brought him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.82,2:07:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远渴望拥有魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will never be rid of his need for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.78,2:07:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对魔戒又爱又恨，就像他对自己爱恨交加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hates and loves the Ring, as he hates and loves himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.66,2:07:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,史麦戈的一生是很悲惨的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smeagol's life is a sad story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.74,2:08:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，魔戒找到他之前，他叫史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Smeagol he was once called. Before the Ring found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.62,2:08:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在魔戒让他发狂之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it drove him mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.66,2:08:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜比尔博当时有机会，却没杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pity Bilbo didn't kill him when he had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.74,2:08:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.02,2:08:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博是可怜他才没杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pity that stayed Bilbo's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.82,2:08:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多活人本来就该死，也有些死人本来命不该绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many that live deserve death. Some that die deserve life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.54,2:08:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能这样断定吗，佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give it to them, Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.42,2:08:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别轻易断定别人的生死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be too eager to deal out death and judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.58,2:08:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就远智者都无法决定命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the very wise cannot see all ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.10,2:08:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直觉地认为不管是好是坏，咕鲁都会跟这趟探险有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart tells me that Gollum has some part to play yet, for good or ill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.78,2:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一切结束前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before this is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.14,2:08:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博一时心软影响了很多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pity of Bilbo may rule the fate of many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.66,2:09:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望魔戒没在我手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish the Ring had never come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.46,2:09:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望这一切都没发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish none of this had happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.66,2:09:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人遇到难关都会这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do all who live to see such times. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.19,2:09:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们无法决定自己的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is not for them to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.50,2:09:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要决定的是在一定的时间内怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to decide is what to do with the time that is given to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.50,2:09:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，世上除了邪恶之外还有别的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other forces at work in this world, Frodo, besides the will of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.90,2:09:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博注定要找到魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo was meant to find the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.86,2:09:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样，你也注定要得到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, you also were meant to have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.38,2:09:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,能这么想就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is an encouraging thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.42,2:09:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.54,2:09:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他记起来了 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's remembered. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.06,2:09:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这儿的空气没那么糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the air doesn't smell so foul down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.06,2:09:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里亚达克，要是迷了路，跟着鼻子走就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If in doubt, Meriadoc, always follow your nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.06,2:10:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒点险再弄亮一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me risk a little more light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.86,2:10:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.38,2:10:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是宏伟的矮人故乡摩瑞亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great realm and Dwarf-city of Dwarrowdelf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.10,2:10:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是令人大开眼界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an eye opener, and no mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.46,2:10:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,金灵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.58,2:11:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.78,2:11:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.82,2:11:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.34,2:11:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,“巴林长眠于此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Here lies Balin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.82,2:11:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,方丁之子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of Fundin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.10,2:11:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚之王”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of Moria."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.82,2:11:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is dead, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.22,2:11:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然和我担心的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as I feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.14,2:11:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走吧，别在这儿逗留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must move on. We cannot linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.30,2:11:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,“他们攻下桥梁和第二大厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They have taken the bridge and the second hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.06,2:12:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们闩住大门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have barred the gates…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.30,2:12:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,却阻挡不了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but cannot hold them for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.98,2:12:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大地在撼动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ground shakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.26,2:12:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓声…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drums…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.18,2:12:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,地底深处传来鼓声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drums in the deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.14,2:12:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃不出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.18,2:12:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗中有一个阴影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Shadow moves in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.66,2:12:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃不出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.30,2:12:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.22,2:13:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个蠢小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fool of a Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.42,2:13:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你自己也跳下去算了，免得我们被你的蠢害死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw yourself in next time, and rid us of your stupidity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.18,2:13:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.18,2:13:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.62,2:14:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！跟着甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Stay close to Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.86,2:14:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一只食人妖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a cave-troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.50,2:14:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她们来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.18,2:14:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚有一个矮人还没死呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one Dwarf yet in Moria who still draws breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.62,2:16:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越厉害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm getting the hang of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.06,2:17:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.34,2:17:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈！亚拉冈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn! Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.22,2:17:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.26,2:18:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.86,2:18:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.38,2:19:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.06,2:19:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.42,2:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事，我没受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. I'm not hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.62,2:19:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该没命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.02,2:19:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一剑连野猪都能刺穿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spear would have skewered a wild boar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.74,2:19:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哈比人远比我们想像的属害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's more to this Hobbit than meets the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.38,2:20:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘银{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mithril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.22,2:20:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是叫人惊讶，巴金斯大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are full of surprises, Master Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.86,2:20:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到凯萨督姆桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Bridge of Khazad-dum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.82,2:20:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.86,2:21:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了什么怪物？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this new devilry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.90,2:22:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,炎魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Balrog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.02,2:22:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,远古的恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon of the ancient world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.38,2:22:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都不是她的对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This foe is beyond any of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.98,2:22:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.90,2:22:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.98,2:22:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.90,2:22:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领他们，亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead them on, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.90,2:22:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge is near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.46,2:22:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的话！快去吧，剑是无法对付炎魔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do as I say! Swords are no more use here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.70,2:23:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.70,2:23:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里！皮聘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry! Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.06,2:23:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.30,2:24:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不能丢矮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody tosses a Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.62,2:24:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抓我胡子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the beard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.26,2:24:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.26,2:24:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,站好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:48.98,2:24:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.98,2:25:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前倾！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lean forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.70,2:25:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.06,2:25:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.42,2:25:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.10,2:25:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过桥！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:30.14,2:25:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:16.34,2:26:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot pass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.58,2:26:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.42,2:26:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是圣火的仆人，高举着亚尔诺炽焰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.30,2:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶之火不会帮你，乌顿之火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.06,2:26:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回黑暗中吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:53.86,2:26:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall not pass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.50,2:27:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行！不行！ - 甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.02,2:27:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻孩子，你们快走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly, you fools!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.62,2:27:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.94,2:27:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.42,2:28:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯，把他们扶起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legolas, get them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:58.30,2:29:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们静一静吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a moment, for pity's sake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:00.38,2:29:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一黑半兽人就会蜂拥而上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By nightfall, these hills will be swarming with Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.22,2:29:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要赶到罗斯洛立安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must reach the woods of Lothlorien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:08.46,2:29:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，波罗莫、勒苟拉斯，金灵，把他们扶起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Boromir. Legolas. Gimli, get them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.26,2:29:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.82,2:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.34,2:29:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.58,2:30:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧了，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close, young Hobbits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.86,2:30:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这儿住了可怕的女巫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that a great sorceress lives in these woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:21.18,2:30:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一个精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Elf-witch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:24.30,2:30:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有强大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of terrible power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:27.70,2:30:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要看她一眼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All who look upon her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.14,2:30:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被她蛊惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fall under her spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.14,2:30:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.66,2:30:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后永远消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are never seen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.94,2:30:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来到这里，带来毁灭的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your coming to us is as the footsteps of doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:42.62,2:30:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把强大的邪恶带来，魔戒持有者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring great evil here, Ring-bearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.54,2:30:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.62,2:30:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可骗不了我这矮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's one Dwarf she won't ensnare so easily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.42,2:31:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有老鹰的锐眼、孤狸的耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the eyes of a hawk and the ears of a fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.62,2:31:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这矮子太聒噪，就算闭着眼睛也能射中他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dwarf breathes so loud, we could have shot him in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.34,2:31:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 欢迎勒苟拉斯，瑟兰督伊之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome Legolas, son of Thranduil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.26,2:31:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我们远征队永远感激你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Fellowship stands in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.74,2:31:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 登丹人亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn of the Dunedain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.06,2:31:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都认得你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are known to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:34.34,2:31:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中精灵不都是很有礼貌吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for the legendary courtesy of the Elves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.82,2:31:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们都听得懂的话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak words we can all understand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.90,2:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从黑暗时期之后就未曾与矮人往来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have not had dealings with the Dwarves since the Dark Days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.74,2:31:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这矮人会怎么说吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what this Dwarf says to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.14,2:31:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很没有礼貌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not so courteous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:01.62,2:32:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带来了强大的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring great evil with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.42,2:32:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的旅程不能再继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go no further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:47.06,2:32:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫不可以白死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf's death was not in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.82,2:32:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会要你放弃希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor would he have you give up hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.22,2:32:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，你的负担很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry a heavy burden, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:58.38,2:33:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要连哀悼也一起背负着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't carry the weight of the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.38,2:33:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.14,2:33:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡拉斯加拉顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caras Galadhon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.70,2:33:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上精灵之乡的主城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart of Elvendom on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.82,2:33:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵皇凯勒鹏与光之女王凯兰崔尔统治之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Realm of the Lord Celeborn and of Galadriel, Lady of Light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.62,2:34:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔君知道你们已经来到此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy knows you have entered here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.38,2:34:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们保持隐密的希望已经破灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What hope you had in secrecy is now gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:59.30,2:35:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿只有八人，但是有九人从瑞文戴尔出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight there are here, yet nine there were set out from Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.98,2:35:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告拆我，甘道夫呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, where is Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:05.98,2:35:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I much desire to speak with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:09.26,2:35:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从远方就看不到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can no longer see him from afar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:12.94,2:35:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰袍巫师甘道夫没能越过这里的边界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf the Grey did not pass the borders of this land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.38,2:35:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他堕入黑暗深渊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has fallen into Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.50,2:35:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被炎魔吞噬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was taken by both Shadow and flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:31.66,2:35:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是魔苟斯炎魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Balrog of Morgoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:36.10,2:35:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们毫无必要的进入摩瑞亚网中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we went needlessly into the net of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.62,2:35:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无必要不是甘道夫一生中会做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needless were none of the deeds of Gandalf in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.50,2:35:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还无法知悉他的用意为何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not yet know his full purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.54,2:35:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让凯萨督姆巨大的虚空占据你的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let the great emptiness of Khazad-dum fill your heart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.02,2:36:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,金灵，葛罗音之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimli, son of Gloin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:01.38,2:36:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界儿满了危险…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the world has grown full of peril…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.38,2:36:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每一个角落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in all lands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.22,2:36:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱已经混杂了悲痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}love is now mingled with grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.34,2:36:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在远征队怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now becomes of this Fellowship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:28.62,2:36:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有甘道夫，希望就破灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without Gandalf, hope is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.58,2:36:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟旅程险象环生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quest stands upon the edge of a knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.02,2:36:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只要一不小心就会失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stray but a little and it will fail…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.86,2:36:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日也会来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the ruin of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:49.06,2:36:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要图结一致就有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet hope remains while the Company is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.42,2:37:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的信心不能动摇，快去休息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let your hearts be troubled. Go now and rest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.58,2:37:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有太多的哀伤和疲惫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you are weary with sorrow and much toil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.54,2:37:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你们要睡在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, you will sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:09.94,2:37:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎，夏尔的佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Frodo of the Shire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:14.82,2:37:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你见过邪眼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one who has seen the Eye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:31.26,2:37:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在为甘道夫哀悼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lament for Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.10,2:37:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they say about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.90,2:37:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不忍心告拆你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not the heart to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:48.38,2:37:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说，伤口仍然太痛了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, the grief is still too near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.62,2:37:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说他们一定不会提起他的烟火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet they don't mention his fireworks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:56.62,2:37:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该写首诗歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a verse about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:03.22,2:38:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,举世无匹烟火秀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finest rockets ever seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:06.34,2:38:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,晶亮蓝绿成星辰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burst in stars of blue and green{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:10.10,2:38:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅若闪电，灿如银雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or after thunder, silver showers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:16.02,2:38:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天女散花差可掇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came falling like a rain of flowers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:18.98,2:38:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全无法形容其精彩程度之万一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that doesn't do them justice by a long road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.58,2:38:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:36.46,2:38:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These borders are well-protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.34,2:38:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里无法休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find no rest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:44.70,2:38:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到她的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard her voice inside my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:48.02,2:38:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她提到我父舰和刚铎的灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spoke of my father and the fall of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.86,2:38:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说现在仍有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said to me, "Even now there is hope left."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:58.70,2:39:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我却看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:02.90,2:39:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们长久以来都没有希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is long since we had any hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.58,2:39:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲摊有高贵情操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is a noble man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:18.50,2:39:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他无法统治刚铎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his rule is failing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:23.82,2:39:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民也失去信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our people lose faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.86,2:39:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望我能成功，我也希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks to me to make things right, and I would do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:31.58,2:39:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要重建刚铎的荣耀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see the glory of Gondor restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.98,2:39:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过吗，亚拉冈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen it, Aragorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:41.58,2:39:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱克西里昂的白塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White Tower of Ecthelion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.82,2:39:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,像珍珠和白银一般闪闪发亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glimmering like a spike of pearl and silver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:48.30,2:39:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔上的旗子随风飘扬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its banners caught high in the morning breeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:54.70,2:39:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有听过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever been called home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.86,2:40:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,银喇叭的召唤声？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the clear ringing of silver trumpets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:01.42,2:40:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久以前见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen the White City…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:04.98,2:40:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这白色城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:07.46,2:40:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天，我们会一起去那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, our paths will lead us there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.38,2:40:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候守卫将高喊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the tower guard shall take up the call:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.74,2:40:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,“刚铎之主回来了”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Lords of Gondor have returned."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:27.30,2:41:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你看着镜子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look into the mirror?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.98,2:41:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will I see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.50,2:41:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最聪明的智者也不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the wisest cannot tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.74,2:41:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为镜子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the mirror…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:39.78,2:41:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能显现各种事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shows many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:45.34,2:41:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.94,2:41:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.26,2:41:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.82,2:42:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚未发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have not yet come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:22.70,2:43:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你看到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it is you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:28.02,2:43:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也在我心里呈现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it is also in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:32.34,2:43:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你失败就会发生这些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is what will come to pass if you should fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.74,2:43:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔戒远征队已经开始四分五裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fellowship is breaking. It is already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.26,2:43:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会试图抢走魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will try to take the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.74,2:43:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我说的是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of whom I speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:50.74,2:43:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会一一被魔戒击垮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one, it will destroy them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:56.94,2:43:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask it of me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.78,2:44:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把至尊魔戒给称{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you the One Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:03.90,2:44:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毫无涤件的给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You offer it to me freely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.66,2:44:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认我很想要魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not deny that my heart has greatly desired this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:20.94,2:44:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将成为魔戒之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In place of a Dark Lord, you would have a queen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:24.70,2:44:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不黑暗，而是美丽，跟曙光一样耀眼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not dark but beautiful, and terrible as the dawn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:29.14,2:44:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟海洋一样高深莫测！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treacherous as the sea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:32.66,2:44:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,远比土地更加坚强！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger than the foundations of the earth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:38.06,2:44:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人都将绝望地…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All shall love me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:40.66,2:44:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,热爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:57.58,2:45:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通过考验了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pass the test. I will diminish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:02.18,2:45:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会退隐到西方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go into the West…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:04.82,2:45:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续当凯兰崔尔女王 - 我一个人无法摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and remain Galadriel. - I cannot do this alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:12.94,2:45:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是魔戒持有者，佛罗多，持有至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a Ring-bearer, Frodo. To bear a Ring of Power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.98,2:45:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须孤单一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:22.82,2:45:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是钻石魔戒南雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Nenya, the Ring of Adamant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:25.78,2:45:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这颗魔戒的持有者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am its keeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:30.58,2:45:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的天命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This task was appointed to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:35.22,2:45:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你办不到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you do not find a way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:39.34,2:45:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:41.70,2:45:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I know what I must do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:45.54,2:45:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.02,2:45:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:55.74,2:46:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再渺小的人也能改变未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the smallest person can change the course of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:06.22,2:46:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道半兽人是怎么来的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how the Orcs first came into being?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.74,2:46:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们曾经是精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were Elves once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:17.22,2:46:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却被黑暗力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken by the Dark Powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:20.78,2:46:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨到不成人形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured and mutilated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:24.30,2:46:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是被扭曲的可怕生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ruined and terrible form of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:29.86,2:46:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却在我手中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:33.18,2:46:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,远到完美境界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}perfected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.74,2:46:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的强兽人战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fighting Uruk-hai…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:40.90,2:46:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的主人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom do you serve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:43.38,2:46:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saruman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:06.74,2:47:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀他们，找不到绝不罢手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt them down. Do not stop until they are found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.38,2:47:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有痛苦也没有恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not know pain. You do not know fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.50,2:47:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只会杀人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will taste Man-flesh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.50,2:47:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个半身人，携带着价值连城的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the halflings carries something of great value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:25.38,2:47:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,连人带物捉来见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them to me alive and unspoiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:31.38,2:47:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:51.86,2:47:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未让外人穿戴上我们的衣裳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before have we clad strangers in the garb of our own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:58.46,2:48:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望披风能保护你们不受邪眼侵扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May these cloaks help shield you from unfriendly eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:09.46,2:48:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰巴斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lembas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:11.30,2:48:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵的行路面包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elvish waybread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:15.42,2:48:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小口就可以填饱一个成人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One small bite is enough to fill the stomach of a grown man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:24.90,2:48:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:27.02,2:48:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,四颗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:34.50,2:48:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,每往南方前进一步，危险就增加一分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every league you travel south, the danger will increase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:37.30,2:48:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔多的半兽人现在把守了安都因河岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mordor Orcs now hold the eastern shore of the Anduin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:41.58,2:48:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西岸也不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor will you find safety on the western bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:44.30,2:48:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸上有白掌印的怪异生物曾在我们的边界出没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange creatures bearing the White Hand have been seen on our borders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:48.30,2:48:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人很少在阳光下走动，但是最近却曾看过一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seldom do Orcs journey in the open under the sun, yet these have done so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.06,2:49:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 你们被跟踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are being tracked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:06.06,2:49:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着河走，你们有机会提脱魔君，先到达拉洛斯瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By river you have the chance of outrunning the enemy to the Falls of Rauros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:28.02,2:49:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你的礼物，勒苟拉斯，是凯兰崔姆树精灵的弓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gift for you, Legolas, is a bow of the Galadhrim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:32.98,2:49:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,配得上森林同胞的武艺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthy of the skill of our woodland kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:41.86,2:49:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是诺多精灵的匕首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the daggers of the Noldorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:44.50,2:49:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经上过战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have already seen service in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:48.66,2:49:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要恐惧，皮瑞格林图克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fear, young Peregrin Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:51.10,2:49:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会找到勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find your courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:56.30,2:49:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的，山姆卫斯詹吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you, Samwise Gamgee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:58.46,2:50:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用希斯蓝制作的精灵绳索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elven rope made of hithlain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:01.18,2:50:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您，女王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:05.14,2:50:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,您没有那些好看闪亮的匕首了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you run out of those nice, shiny daggers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:14.90,2:50:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人想从精灵这边要什么样的礼物？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what gift would a dwarf ask of the Elves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:18.10,2:50:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:20.86,2:50:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只求能再看一眼，凯兰崔姆女王的容颜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except to look upon the lady of the Galadhrim one last time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.82,2:50:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的容颜比地底下所有的珠宝更灿烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for she is more fair than all the jewels beneath the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:37.10,2:50:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:38.82,2:50:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一项东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:41.30,2:50:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我在说傻话，这是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I couldn't. It's quite impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:44.14,2:50:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很蠢的的间题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:49.46,2:50:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing greater to give…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:51.78,2:50:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会比你拥有的更珍贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the gift you already bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:56.58,2:50:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 她的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:58.94,2:51:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕亚玟灿星的力量会减弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the grace of Arwen Evenstar will diminish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:05.06,2:51:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我会要她远离河岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have her leave these shores, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:09.90,2:51:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她的族人在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be with her people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:14.82,2:51:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会要她乘船到瓦林诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have her take the ship to Valinor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:20.82,2:51:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,做选择的是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That choice is yet before her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:24.62,2:51:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也有抉择要做，亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your own choice to make, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:27.82,2:51:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克服你所有的祖先面对的障碍，从伊兰迪尔在位那时的开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rise above the height of all your fathers since the days of Elendil…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:33.86,2:51:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是跟你的家族一样堕入黑暗深渊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or to fall into darkness with all that is left of your kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:45.46,2:51:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 再会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:50.62,2:51:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 你还有很多事要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much you have yet to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:00.50,2:52:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 我们不会再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall not meet again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:01.94,2:52:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊力萨王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elessar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.74,2:52:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:09.14,2:52:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你埃兰迪尔之光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you the light of Earendil…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:13.30,2:52:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最挚爱的星辰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our most beloved star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.78,2:52:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿它在所有光亮熄灭时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May it be a light for you in dark places…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:29.42,2:52:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗中为你照明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all other lights go out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.50,2:52:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次离开让我再心痛不过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have taken my worst wound at this parting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:46.30,2:52:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最后一次见到最美丽的容颜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}having looked my last upon that which is fairest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.34,2:52:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此之后，对我来说除了她的礼物，没有什么是美的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henceforth I will call nothing fair unless it be her gift to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.94,2:52:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的礼物是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her gift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:57.06,2:53:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她要一根她的金发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her for one hair from her golden head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:02.78,2:53:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了我三根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave me three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:47.82,2:54:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕鲁，他从摩瑞亚开始就一直跟踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gollum. He has tracked us since Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:55.02,2:54:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还希望能在河上提脱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped we would lose him on the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:58.34,2:55:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他太熟知水性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's too clever a waterman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:02.34,2:55:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他告知魔君我们现在的方位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he alerts the enemy to our whereabouts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:05.82,2:55:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们渡河就更危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will make the crossing even more dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:08.22,2:55:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃点东西，佛罗多大斧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some food, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:10.46,2:55:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不了，山姆 - 你整天都没吃东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Sam. - You haven't eaten anything all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:13.74,2:55:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也睡不着，不要以为我没有注意到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sleeping, neither. Don't think I haven't noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:17.78,2:55:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛罗多大爷… - 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Frodo… - I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:21.02,2:55:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.50,2:55:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮助你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:25.14,2:55:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟甘道夫保证过我会帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised Gandalf that I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:32.82,2:55:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不上忙的，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't help me, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:37.70,2:55:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次帮不上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:42.34,2:55:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:50.70,2:55:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯比较安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minas Tirith is the safer road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:53.42,2:55:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的，那里我们可以重整力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that. From there we can regroup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.86,2:55:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,更利于我们出发到达魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike out for Mordor from a place of strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:59.38,2:56:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚铎对我们而言没有什么有利之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no strength in Gondor that can avail us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:02.70,2:56:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很轻易就信任精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were quick enough to trust the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:06.58,2:56:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对人类自己就没有信心吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you so little faith in your own people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:09.58,2:56:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我们有弱点，我们有缺陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there is weakness. There is frailty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:12.74,2:56:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人类也有勇气与荣誊感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is courage also, and honor to be found in Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:16.30,2:56:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不肯承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will not see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:18.82,2:56:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在恐惧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are afraid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:20.50,2:56:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一生都藏在阴影之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your life, you have hidden in the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:23.34,2:56:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧你的来处，你的身分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared of who you are, of what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:29.22,2:56:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让魔戒靠近你的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not lead the Ring within a hundred leagues of your city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:45.46,2:56:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:48.66,2:56:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚苟那斯巨像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Argonath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:53.62,2:56:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想仰望过往的王者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long have I desired to look upon the kings of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:58.10,2:57:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的祖先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:19.06,2:58:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一黑就过湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cross the lake at nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:21.46,2:58:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船藏好再用走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide the boats and continue on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:24.26,2:58:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从北边进入魔多 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We approach Mordor from the North. - Oh, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:28.06,2:58:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要通过爱明莫尔就行了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a simple matter of finding our way through Emyn Muil…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:32.06,2:58:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是充满尖石的迷宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an impassable labyrinth of razor-sharp rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:35.50,2:58:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢，就更精采了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after that, it gets even better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.02,2:58:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有一望无际的臭沼泽地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Festering, stinking marshland as far as the eye can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:44.10,2:58:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走这条路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is our road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:47.06,2:58:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你休息吧，养精蓄锐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you take some rest and recover your strength, Master Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.46,2:58:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,养精蓄锐个头…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recover my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:55.22,2:58:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们最好马上启程 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should leave now. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:57.38,2:59:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人在巡逻东岸，一定要等到天黑再出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs patrol the eastern shore. We must wait for cover of darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:02.02,2:59:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的不是东岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not the eastern shore that worries me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:05.66,2:59:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心中一直有一个阴影，一个逐渐壮大的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow and a threat has been growing in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:10.18,2:59:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么正在接近，我感觉得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something draws near. I can feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:16.34,2:59:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人族才不必养精蓄锐，别理他，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recover strength? Pay no heed to that, young Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:21.82,2:59:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:49.18,2:59:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不该一个人乱跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us should wander alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:52.46,2:59:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, least of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:54.82,2:59:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的责任重大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much depends on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.30,3:00:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:07.34,3:00:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想一个人静静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you seek solitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:10.66,3:00:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天天看着你受苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suffer. I see it day by day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:14.86,3:00:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你不是白白受苦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you do not suffer needlessly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:19.58,3:00:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他的路，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other ways, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:22.46,3:00:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以走其他的路 - 我知道你想说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Other paths that we might take. - I know what you would say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:26.50,3:00:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像很有道理，但我得到警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem like wisdom but for the warning in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:30.50,3:00:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告？什么警告？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning? Against what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:33.82,3:00:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很害怕，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all afraid, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:36.14,3:00:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果让恐惧摧毁一切希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to let that fear drive us, to destroy what hope we have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:39.98,3:00:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 未免太荒谬了吧？ - 没有别的路可走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- don't you see that is madness? - There is no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:45.54,3:00:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要捍卫人民的力量！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask only for the strength to defend my people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:50.46,3:00:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把魔戒借我 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you would but lend me the Ring. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:53.74,3:00:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为何退缩？我不是强盗 - 你失去理智了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why do you recoil? I am no thief. - You are not yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:59.22,3:01:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能成功吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What chance do you think you have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:02.74,3:01:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到你，把魔戒抢走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will find you. They will take the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:07.62,3:01:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你求生不能、求死不得！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will beg for death before the end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:13.46,3:01:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这傻子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:15.74,3:01:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是靠运气得到它，它应该是我的，给我吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not yours, save by unhappy chance! It could have been mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:19.94,3:01:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它应该是我的！给我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be mine! Give it to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:22.94,3:01:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快给我！ - 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to me! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:24.38,3:01:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我！ - 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to me! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:33.86,3:01:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.10,3:01:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把魔戒给索伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take the Ring to Sauron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:39.30,3:01:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会背叛我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will betray us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:41.38,3:01:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害我们跟你一起死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll go to your death, and the death of us all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:44.98,3:01:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我诅咒你和所有的半身人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse you! Curse you and all the halflings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:55.70,3:01:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:01.54,3:02:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:07.06,3:02:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:09.30,3:02:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:11.22,3:02:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多，对不起！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:02.50,3:03:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:05.18,3:03:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它盘惑了波罗莫 - 魔戒呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It has taken Boromir. - Where is the Ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:08.46,3:03:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:10.66,3:03:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:14.50,3:03:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓要保护你 - 你能保证不害我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I swore to protect you. - Can you protect me from yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.02,3:03:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会摧毁它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you destroy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.50,3:03:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:40.86,3:03:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:44.98,3:03:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊力萨王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elessar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:54.50,3:03:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意跟随你到最后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have gone with you to the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:58.54,3:04:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随你到魔多烈焰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the very fires of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:04.74,3:04:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:08.34,3:04:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾他们，尤其是山姆，他不会了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after the others. Especially Sam. He will not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:17.58,3:04:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:22.26,3:04:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:24.02,3:04:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:50.26,3:04:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:01.18,3:05:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找半身人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the halfling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:04.62,3:05:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找半身人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the halfling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:10.62,3:05:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊兰迪尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elendil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:18.78,3:05:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚拉冈，快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aragorn, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:42.06,3:05:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:43.94,3:05:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide here. Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:46.18,3:05:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:50.10,3:05:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:56.38,3:05:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:03.18,3:06:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 皮聘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:11.02,3:06:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑吧，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Frodo. Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:13.90,3:06:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂！ - 在这儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Hey, you! - Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:17.38,3:06:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里啦！ - 这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over here! - This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:29.86,3:06:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了！ - 我知道啦！快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's working! - I know it's working! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:27.54,3:07:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚铎的号角 - 波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The horn of Gondor. - Boromir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:13.70,3:08:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:46.42,3:11:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:51.98,3:11:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们把小的抓走了 - 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They took the little ones. - Hold still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:55.26,3:11:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多呢？佛罗多在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo. Where is Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:59.18,3:12:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Frodo go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:01.34,3:12:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到我做不到的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you did what I could not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:04.94,3:12:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要抢走魔戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to take the Ring from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:08.78,3:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在谁也抢不走魔戒了 - 原谅我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Ring is beyond our reach now. - Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:13.26,3:12:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:15.74,3:12:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我让大家失望了 - 不，波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have failed you all. - No, Boromir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:19.38,3:12:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你英勇的作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fought bravely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:22.22,3:12:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你维护了你的尊严{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have kept your honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:25.50,3:12:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:27.74,3:12:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:31.02,3:12:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类世界将灭亡，黑暗将笼罩大地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world of Men will fall. And all will come to darkness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:36.70,3:12:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的城市将遭毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my city to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:43.74,3:12:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我有多大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what strength is in my blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:46.66,3:12:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我发誓绝不会让白城沦陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I swear to you, I will not let the White City fall…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:51.66,3:12:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会让我们的人民失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor our people fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:55.14,3:12:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:00.34,3:13:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:24.18,3:13:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿跟随你，兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have followed you, my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:28.74,3:13:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:33.38,3:13:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:54.94,3:13:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,安息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be at peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:57.58,3:13:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚铎之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:16.02,3:14:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会盼望他回到白色要塞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will look for his coming from the White Tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:19.86,3:14:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他回不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he will not return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:46.10,3:14:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:07.54,3:15:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望魔戒没在我手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish the Ring had never come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:12.10,3:15:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望这一切都没发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish none of this had happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:18.06,3:15:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人遇到难关都会这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do all who live to see such times…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:21.02,3:15:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们无法决定自己的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is not for them to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:24.70,3:15:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to decide…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:27.54,3:15:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定的时间内决定如何去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is what to do with the time that is given to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:01.10,3:16:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:03.74,3:16:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:05.82,3:16:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛罗多大爷！ - 不，山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Frodo! - No, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:12.02,3:16:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去吧，山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:14.50,3:16:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要一个人去魔多 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to Mordor alone. - Of course you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:18.30,3:16:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要跟你一起去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm coming with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:21.62,3:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会游泳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't swim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:27.82,3:16:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:35.14,3:16:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:17.38,3:17:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我许下一个承诺，佛罗多大爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:20.42,3:17:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个承诺是：“千万别离开他，山姆卫斯詹吉”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A promise: "Don't you leave him, Samwise Gamgee."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:25.90,3:17:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不离开你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't mean to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:28.78,3:17:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:32.62,3:17:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:49.34,3:17:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:19.46,3:18:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！佛果多和山姆到东岸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Frodo and Sam have reached the eastern shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:38.90,3:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不打算跟去 - 我们帮不了佛罗多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean not to follow them. - Frodo's fate is no longer in our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:47.30,3:18:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们一切的努力都白费了，远征队也彻底失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it has all been in vain. The Fellowship has failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:04.02,3:19:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的努力不会白费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we hold true to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:08.58,3:19:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下梅里和皮聘让他们受苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not abandon Merry and Pippin to torment and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:14.06,3:19:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们还有力气，不用的都留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while we have strength left. Leave all that can be spared behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:20.58,3:19:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量减轻负担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We travel light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:22.82,3:19:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去猎杀半兽人吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us hunt some Orc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:27.70,3:19:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:48.70,3:19:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:50.78,3:19:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望其他人走的路比较安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the others find a safer road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:55.10,3:19:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,神行客会照顾他们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strider will look after them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:58.58,3:20:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们不会再见到他们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose we'll ever see them again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:02.30,3:20:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗多大爷，我们也许还会再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may yet, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:04.94,3:20:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:08.54,3:20:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:13.22,3:20:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴有你陪着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you are with me.{\r}
